UID:41758-1786478400-1786482000@www.torontomastergardeners.ca
SUMMARY:Fabulous Ferns
DESCRIPTION:Fascinating facts about ferns! To know them is to love them. Learn about their ancient pedigree and how they reproduce. Get to know fern structure – how to find the fertile fronds. Where do they grow\, you ask? Forests\, bogs\, fields\, rock faces… and shade borders! Advice on where and when to plant them\, maintaining and dividing them\, and dealing with pests and problems. Learn how to enhance your garden with over 18 individual ferns including pictures and growing information.
URL:https://www.torontomastergardeners.ca/event/fabulous-ferns-3/
LOCATION:ON
END:VEVENT
